---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Tutoring - Odiuko Educational Services" currentPath="/tutoring">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Tutoring</h1>
    <p>Personal tutoring for children in Basic 1 to 6.</p>
    <div class="line">
      <div class="pin blue"><span class="big">+ −</span><h3>Math</h3><p>Number sense, operations and problem solving, taught in clear steps with plenty of practice.</p></div>
      <div class="pin green"><span class="big">Aa</span><h3>Reading and spelling</h3><p>Phonics, fluency, comprehension and spelling at your child’s level.</p></div>
      <div class="pin orange"><span class="big">✎</span><h3>Learning support</h3><p>Homework help, organisation and good study habits.</p></div>
    </div>
    <h2>Choose how to learn</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="paper"><h3>In-home</h3><p>A tutor comes to you. Areas covered: [add areas in Lagos].</p></div>
      <div class="paper"><h3>Online</h3><p>Live lessons from home. You only need a device and a stable connection.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p>Our focus is Basic 1 to 6. Support for older learners (K-12) is available on request.</p>
    <h2>Pricing</h2>
    <p>[Add pricing or pricing guide here.]</p>
    <a class="btn" href="/contact">Book a consultation</a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>